+What:           /config/usb-gadget/gadget/os_desc/container_id
+Description:
+                Optional Microsoft OS 1.0 ContainerID for grouping this gadget
+                with functions on other buses, such as a display-associated
+                digitizer. Read/write canonical UUID text; writing is allowed
+                only while the gadget is unbound. The all-zero UUID disables
+                the descriptor (default). A nonzero UUID advertises bit 1 in
+                the Microsoft OS string flags and answers device vendor reads
+                at wIndex 6. os_desc/use and its vendor code must be configured.
